OL,3,GNEWSAJudge to decide trial after jury
OL,4,Atampering claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FA judge has discharged the jury in the
OL,7,Ftrial of five men accused of carrying
OL,8,Fout a machete attack in Bradford,
OL,9,Ffollowing allegations of jury
OL,10,Ftampering.
OL,12,FThe men are accused of conspiracy to
OL,13,Fmurder and conspiracy to cause grievous
OL,14,Fbodily harm with intent in relation to
OL,15,Fthe alleged attack in May 2025 which
OL,16,Fresulted in a man having his hand cut
OL,17,Foff by a machete.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
