OL,3,GNEWSAJudge to decide trial after jury
OL,4,Atampering claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, the Recorder of Bradford,
OL,7,FJudge Jonathan Rose, lifted reporting
OL,8,Frestrictions that had prevented the
OL,9,Fmedia from reporting the jury had been
OL,10,Fremoved in August.
OL,12,FJudge Rose is expected to hear closing
OL,13,Fsubmissions from the prosecution and
OL,14,Fdefence before returning verdicts
OL,15,Fhimself.
